{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10026","headline":"怀鲁 · 程弥纶","name":"怀鲁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曲阜国，尼丘山。\n周公邈难问，夫子犹啓关。\n履风雩兮若见，游夏兴兮鲁颜。\n天孙天孙，何爲今兮学且难，负星明而东游闲闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"程弥纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}